--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relationship to the original work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Measured against mkXultra/ai-cli-mcp at v2.23.0 (2026-09-06), 299 of this
project's 1,980 substantive source lines (~15%) are identical to the
upstream tree, concentrated in the MCP tool surface and the CLI/MCP entry
points. The remainder — the agent registry, the circuit breaker, the
direct-api backend, the model catalog with provenance, the background
updater, the ConPTY runner, liveness reporting, the peek extractor, config
handling, doctor and the usage plugin — is original to this project.
